Z||000005||Raydar||05-11-2001||05:02 PM||||You might check your tail light and side marker light sockets, too. They all come on with the parking lights. I'm not sure if they're on the same fuse, though. Just a guess.<P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<P>88 black Formula<BR>88 Duke coupe <BR>88 "wadded up" Formula (parts car)||||reg||1
